    <edge id="rel:doc:98efa0:MENTIONS:entity:sap-btp:ba8be48928" source="doc:98efa0" target="entity:sap-btp">
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_from_id">doc:98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_to_id">entity:sap-btp</data>
      <data key="e_from_type">Document</data>
      <data key="e_to_type">SAPService</data>
      <data key="e_source_id">doc:docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://architecture.learning.sap.com/docs/ref-arch/98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_source_file">docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_section">Architecture</data>
      <data key="e_evidence">The architecture centers around **Joule** as the orchestrator, with custom agents on **SAP BTP** connected to **SAP Cloud Solutions** and **3rd Party Systems**:</data>
      <data key="e_evidence_type">explicit</data>
      <data key="e_confidence">0.85</data>
      <data key="e_repository_commit">4635f734f2f82c6497bc53d5cf972b5cbfec5e52</data>
      <data key="e_extraction_date">2026-07-13T12:40:19.509590+00:00</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="rel:doc:98efa0:MENTIONS:entity:joule:ba8be48928" source="doc:98efa0" target="entity:joule">
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_from_id">doc:98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_to_id">entity:joule</data>
      <data key="e_from_type">Document</data>
      <data key="e_to_type">Agent</data>
      <data key="e_source_id">doc:docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://architecture.learning.sap.com/docs/ref-arch/98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_source_file">docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_section">Architecture</data>
      <data key="e_evidence">- **3rd Party Integration:** External (AI) platforms (Google Cloud, Microsoft Azure, AWS, IBM Cloud) and (AI) clients consume Joule Agents via the Agent Gateway or are orchestrated by Joule.</data>
      <data key="e_evidence_type">explicit</data>
      <data key="e_confidence">0.85</data>
      <data key="e_repository_commit">4635f734f2f82c6497bc53d5cf972b5cbfec5e52</data>
      <data key="e_extraction_date">2026-07-13T12:40:19.509590+00:00</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="rel:doc:98efa0:MENTIONS:entity:joule-studio:ba8be48928" source="doc:98efa0" target="entity:joule-studio">
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_type">MENTIONS</data>
      <data key="e_from_id">doc:98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_to_id">entity:joule-studio</data>
      <data key="e_from_type">Document</data>
      <data key="e_to_type">SAPService</data>
      <data key="e_source_id">doc:docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://architecture.learning.sap.com/docs/ref-arch/98efa0</data>
      <data key="e_source_file">docs/ref-arch/RA0029/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_source_section">Architecture</data>
      <data key="e_evidence">- **Custom Agents on SAP BTP:** Two development approaches - **Low-Code** via Joule Studio with visual configuration and automatic Joule registration and **Pro-Code** using SAP Cloud SDK for AI with frameworks (LangGraph, AG2, CrewAI, Smolagents) integrated via A2A protocol.</data>
      <data key="e_evidence_type">explicit</data>
      <data key="e_confidence">0.85</data>
      <data key="e_repository_commit">4635f734f2f82c6497bc53d5cf972b5cbfec5e52</data>
      <data key="e_extraction_date">2026-07-13T12:40:19.509590+00:00</data>
    </edge>
