      <data key="e_source_file">docs/ref-arch/RA0029/1-a2a-and-mcp/readme.md</data>
      <data key="e_evidence">SAP has adopted two open standards, the **Agent2Agent (A2A) protocol** and the **Model Context Protocol (MCP)**, to create a decoupled architecture where agents and tools can be developed, deployed and updated independently.</data>
      <data key="e_evidence_type">explicit</data>
